.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Aug 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-events-estimate-fees - Estimate fees for a pay in advance charge


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago events estimate-fees [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Estimate the fees that would be created after reception of an event for a billable metric attached to one or multiple pay in advance charges


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--code\fP=""
	The code that identifies a targeted billable metric. It is essential that this code matches the 'code' property of one of your active billable metrics. If the provided code does not correspond to any active billable metric, it will be ignored during the process.

.PP
\fB--external-subscription-id\fP=""
	The unique identifier of the subscription within your application.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for estimate-fees

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	Idempotency key for safe mutation retries

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--properties-target-wallet-code\fP=""
	The code of the wallet targeted by this event for prepaid credits deduction.
When provided, credits are drawn from this specific wallet instead of following the standard wallet selection logic.
If the code does not match an existing wallet, no credits will be applied for the event.
This field is only taken into account when the targeted charge has 'accepts_target_wallet' set to 'true'.
This field requires a premium integration.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago events estimate-fees --input @payload.json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlago-events(1)\fP
